/page/Special_event_items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">Special event items</a></b>, European servers\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Unique item capacity\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>3\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Max stack size\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>1,000\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Toughness_(enchantment)\" title=\"Toughness (enchantment)\">Toughness</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Toughness:</b> While equipped this item grants 20 additional hitpoints. This stacks with all bonuses except for other items bearing the Toughness enchantment.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Arcane_Casting_Dexterity\" title=\"Arcane Casting Dexterity\">Arcane Casting Dexterity</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Arcane_Casting_Dexterity\" title=\"Arcane Casting Dexterity\">Arcane Casting Dexterity</a>:</b> This ability reduces the <a href=\"/page/Arcane_spell_failure\" title=\"Arcane spell failure\">arcane spell failure</a> chance by -10%.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Seeker\" title=\"Seeker\"> Seeker +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Seeker\" title=\"Seeker\"> Seeker +10</a>:</b> Provides a +10 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to confirm critical hits, and a +10 Enhancement bonus to critical hit damage (before multipliers are applied).</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magic_Device\" title=\"Use Magic Device\">Use Magic Device +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Use_Magic_Device\" title=\"Use Magic Device\">Use Magic Device +5</a>:</b> Passive: +5 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Use_Magic_Device\" title=\"Use Magic Device\">Use Magic Device</a> skill.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Seeker_Tap_of_Spellsight.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Seeker_Tap_of_Spellsight.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"312\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><i>This thin quiver, available from House Deneith, will hold 3 different types of arrow or bolt and can store each type of up to 1000. Total capacity: 3000.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">Given away on the European servers by Codemasters. It is not native to any of the American servers.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817225312\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.134 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3954/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23937/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7019/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n111.45%  129.575     51 Template:IO\n100.00%  116.264      1 -total\n 92.10%  107.082      1 Template:Named_item\n 88.04%  102.356      1 Template:Quiver\n 36.58%   42.532      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 35.86%   41.688      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 35.09%   40.800      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.30%   39.876      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.82%   20.716      5 Template:Popup\n 16.59%   19.287      1 Template:Non-food\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:33859-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817225312 and revision id 634547. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
